# ==========================
# Internal working documents
# ==========================
# The public repository should show the code and one README that explains
# the project. The audit, the phased action plan, the operator runbook and
# the session handoffs are how the work got done, not what was built --
# they name internal decisions, terminal layouts and machine paths, and
# they are noise (at best) to anyone arriving from a CV.
#
# Keep them on disk. They are still the reference for this project.
CODEBASE_AUDIT.md
ACTION_PLAN.md
KAMRAN_RUNBOOK.md
SESSION_HANDOFF.md
IMPLEMENTATION_ROADMAP.md
NIAM_PULL_GUIDE.md
*_HANDOFF.md
*_RUNBOOK.md
